      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "**long: 8/10**\npretty good but still sometimes brakes a little late. doesn’t go for greens or stop consistently at stop signs/lights. \n\n**lat: 3/10**\ncan do turns sometimes and sometimes feels smart but it has HEAVY right bias for me that makes it near unusable \n\n**overall: 5/10**:\nit’s usable but not my favorite model. even the big versions don’t improve enough on the issues to be worth it!",
